[[2047,127,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>Place the car on the  lifting\nbridge.</p><p><a href=\"#/3238225\">4450B11</a></p><p>1. Unscrew screws (1a) and move rear brake caliper (1b) away from\nbracket.</p><p>2. Remove rear brake pads.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2017781.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[2047,127,0,"<p>1. Unscrew pin (1a) and remove rear brake disc (1b).</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2017782.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[2047,127,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Mount rear brake disc and fix\nit with its pin to the couple.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001243.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Fastening</p></th><th><p>Component</p></th><th><p>Ø</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Value</p><p>(daNm)</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Pin</p></td><td><p>REAR BRAKE DISCS</p></td><td><p>M8</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>0.8 - 1.3</p></td></tr></table></div><p>1. Compress rear brake caliper piston (1a)  by the tool (1b) to\nease brake caliper assembling.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001268.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Country</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1b</p></td><td><p>Key</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>1.822.108.000</p></td></tr></table></div><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2017783.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[2047,127,0,"<p>Mount rear brake caliper including\npads and fix it with its screws to the couple.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001243.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Fastening</p></th><th><p>Component</p></th><th><p>Ø</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Value</p><p>(daNm)</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Bolt</p></td><td><p>REAR BRAKE CALIPER</p></td><td><p>M10</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>4.8 - 5.2</p></td></tr></table></div><p><a href=\"#/3238225\">4450B11</a></p><p>Take the car off the lifting bridge.</p>"]]